From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LunaticKochiya <125438787@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] kernel: config-6.18: pin new symbols that block syncconfig

The eBPF build enables CONFIG_KERNEL_BPF_EVENTS, which selects
KERNEL_KPROBES -> KERNEL_PERF_EVENTS -> KERNEL_ARM_PMUV3. With ARM_PMUV3
on, Linux 6.18.52 exposes the new ARM64_BRBE symbol (default y) and the
non-interactive kernel configuration aborts:

  * Restart config...
  Enable support for branch stack sampling using FEAT_BRBE (ARM64_BRBE) [Y/n/?] (NEW)
  make[8]: *** [scripts/kconfig/Makefile:85: syncconfig] Error 1

BTF and DRM-client symbols added since config-6.18 was generated have the
same problem once KERNEL_DEBUG_INFO_BTF and the all-kmods build enable
their parent menus.

Give every affected symbol an explicit value:

  ARM64_BRBE                  not needed by the router images
  ARM_PMU                    y, matches the oldconfig default
  DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES     y, keep split BTF for loadable modules
  MODULE_ALLOW_BTF_MISMATCH  n, keep the strict BTF check
  DRM_CLIENT_DEFAULT_FBDEV   y, fbdev is the default client

Signed-off-by: LunaticKochiya <125438787@qq.com>
---
diff --git a/target/linux/generic/config-6.18 b/target/linux/generic/config-6.18
--- a/target/linux/generic/config-6.18
+++ b/target/linux/generic/config-6.18
@@ -371,6 +371,7 @@
 # CONFIG_ARM64_16K_PAGES is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_64K_PAGES is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_AMU_EXTN is not set
+# CONFIG_ARM64_BRBE is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_BTI is not set
 CONFIG_ARM64_CNP=y
 # CONFIG_ARM64_CONTPTE is not set
@@ -479,6 +480,7 @@
 # CONFIG_ARM_NI is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM_PAN is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM_PATCH_PHYS_VIRT is not set
+CONFIG_ARM_PMU=y
 # CONFIG_ARM_PSCI is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM_PSCI_CHECKER is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM_PSCI_CPUIDLE is not set
@@ -1387,6 +1389,7 @@
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_ICEDCC is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF is not set
+CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_COMPRESSED_NONE=y
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_COMPRESSED_ZLIB is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_COMPRESSED_ZSTD is not set
@@ -1580,6 +1583,7 @@
 # CONFIG_DRM_CHIPONE_ICN6211 is not set
 # CONFIG_DRM_CHRONTEL_CH7033 is not set
 # CONFIG_DRM_CIRRUS_QEMU is not set
+CONFIG_DRM_CLIENT_DEFAULT_FBDEV=y
 # CONFIG_DRM_CLIENT_LOG is not set
 # CONFIG_DRM_DEBUG_DP_MST_TOPOLOGY_REFS is not set
 # CONFIG_DRM_DEBUG_MM is not set
@@ -4015,6 +4019,7 @@
 CONFIG_MODULES=y
+# CONFIG_MODULE_ALLOW_BTF_MISMATCH is not set
 # CONFIG_MODULE_ALLOW_MISSING_NAMESPACE_IMPORTS is not set
 # CONFIG_MODULE_COMPRESS is not set
 # CONFIG_MODULE_COMPRESS_GZIP is not set
 # CONFIG_MODULE_COMPRESS_XZ is not set
 # CONFIG_MODULE_COMPRESS_ZSTD is not set
-- 
